                <!-- Bond Details Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 10px">

                    Dear Sir/Madam <br><br><b>Sub: <u>Change of Status for your ‘Minor’ RBI Bonds Investment</u></b><br><br>
                    <br><br>

<!--                    Trust you are doing well.<br><br>-->



                    We observe from our records, that you are the first applicant in the RBI Bonds held in the capacity of “Minor” under <b>BLA : {{x.blaNo}}.</b>
                    and Your date of birth, as per Bank Records, is <b>{{x.bondHolderDOB}}</b><br><br>




                    As you already turned major (i.e. 18 years of age), we request you to <b>submit the documents for accompanied by your guardian to convert the 'minor' Investment you have with us</b>(BLA : {{x.blaNo}})<b> into 'Major' status.</b><br><br>



                    To facilitate the conversion of your Investment (s) with the Bank, we request you to please submit the below-mentioned documents to your nearest HDFC Bank branch:<br><br>



                    <ul class="doc-list">

                        <li>
                            Request letter for converting the Investment from 'Minor' to 'Major.'
                            If applicable, this letter should be signed by you
                            (the minor becoming a major), your guardian,
                            and any other co-applicants.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Self-attested copy of your PAN card as a major.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Self-attested proof of address. If you provide Aadhaar as address proof,
                            please black out the first 8 digits of the Aadhaar number and include
                            the non-DBT consent form (as per the attached format).
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Proof of becoming a major (Birth Certificate, Passport, etc.).
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            ECS mandate form (attached) with Banker's verification,
                            along with a cancelled cheque leaf.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Original Bond certificate.
                        </li>

                    </ul>


                    Kindly dispatch the original to the above mentioned address or the same can be submitted at our nearest hdfc bank branch.<br><br>
                    Assuring you of the best of our services.<br><br>
                    Warm Regards,<br><br>
                    <b>Karthikeyan.M</b><br><br>
                    Encl: 1. ECS Mandate Form, 2. Non- DBT consent form

                </div>



                    </table>



